{%- doc -%}
  Renders a Villain-style demo product grid for one ORVIANE Shop All category.
  @param {string} demo_category - bestsellers | new_arrivals | gifting
  @param {object} section - Parent section settings (labels, card options)
  @param {collection} catalog - Collection for add-to-cart fallback
  @param {number} [demo_cart_variant_id]
{%- enddoc -%}

